# Morrowind Temple: Archcanon Tholer Saryoni's last duty, the Ebony Mail (TT_Assarnibibi). As Master (8), "duties"
# asks for the Ebony Mail ("Ebony Mail": 10). Boethiah's shrine atop Mount Assarnibibi, once all four corners are
# done, grants it (100, shrineAssarnibibi). Shown to Tholer Saryoni ("Yes, here it is." 1) it makes the player
# Patriarch (110, PCRaiseRank).
# Master asks one favored skill at 80, two at 30, Personality and Intelligence of 34 and reputation 100 (MorrowindRuntime's
# FACT table): SetRestoration, SetMysticism and SetAlchemy stand in for training, SetPersonality and SetIntelligence for
# level-up choices. Position stands in for the travel. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 05B2907B the shrine.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_fourcorners_alddaedroth --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_master
run
player->SetRestoration 80
player->SetMysticism 30
player->SetAlchemy 30
player->SetPersonality 34
player->SetIntelligence 34
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Temple >= 8
bye
end

case tt_ebonymail_start
run
player->PositionCell -1097 400 -622 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "tholer saryoni"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk tholer saryoni
ask duties
ask Ebony Mail
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Assarnibibi == 10
bye
end

case tt_ebonymail_shrine
run
player->Position 120194 -28450 4104 0
wait 120
activate 05B2907B
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_Assarnibibi == 100
expect player->GetItemCount ebon_plate_cuirass_unique == 1
end

case tt_ebonymail_done
run
player->PositionCell -1097 400 -622 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "tholer saryoni"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk tholer saryoni
ask Ebony Mail
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Assarnibibi == 110
expect player->GetPCRank Temple == 9
bye
end
